* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.psd binary
*.ase binary
*.aseprite binary
*.fbx binary
*.blend binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.glb binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff2 binary
# TMP SDF font atlases are large binary ScriptableObjects:
Assets/UI/Localization/Fonts/*.asset binary

# Git LFS is intentionally NOT used: the anemora-viewer build extracts image
# bytes via `git archive` over a blob:none clone, which would emit LFS pointer
# text instead of pixels and break thumbnail generation. The bloat guard
# (tools/githooks) blocks any `filter=lfs` line from being added here.

# Hook scripts must stay LF even on Windows:
tools/githooks/* text eol=lf
